BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[FFXIV] FINAL FANTASY XIV x FINAL FANTASY XVI Crossover Event Retu
 rns!
DTSTART:20261111T080000Z
DTEND:20261125T080000Z
DTSTAMP:20261113T141232Z
UID:3108d0da2fdf@mmo-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The FINAL FANTASY XVI crossover event\, The Path Infernal\, re
 turns to Eorzea!\n\nParticipate in the event to obtain several event items
 \, including the Torgal mount\, the Metian Attire inspired by protagonist 
 Clive Rosfield\, a minion\, orchestrion rolls\, and more. Whether you mis
 sed the previous event or simply wish to experience the adventure again\, 
 don't miss out!
URL:https://na.finalfantasyxiv.com/lodestone/topics/detail/44d7f515b615760
 2c144c5dba37a110bdecda702
END:VEVENT
